## 🎨 OneOhm V2 Style

| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Font size | `text-[13px]` |
| Weight | 400 body, 500 label, 600 title |
| Border | `border-gray-100` |
| Radius | `rounded-lg` |
| Padding | `p-4` |
| Shadow | `shadow-sm` or none |

```
❌ font-bold     → font-semibold
❌ gray-200      → gray-100
❌ rounded-xl    → rounded-lg
❌ p-6           → p-4
```

