## 🧩 UI Components

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Form | react-hook-form + Zod |
| Table | AG Grid or `<Table>` |
| Loading | `<Skeleton>` |
| Empty | `<EmptyState>` |
| Modal | `<Dialog>` or `<Sheet>` |
| Status | `<Badge>` |

---

## ⚠️ UX Safety

Every view MUST have:
- Loading state
- Error state  
- Empty state

**No silent failures. Ever.**

