## ⚡ Quick Reference

| Action | How |
|--------|-----|
| API call | `apiClient.get/post/patch/delete` |
| Auth token | Automatic via interceptor |
| Org ID | `useOrganization()` |
| Toast | `toast.success()` / `toast.error()` |
| Navigate | `useRouter().push()` |
